{"html": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Toge Greenhouse Project</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Project KILLDANCE was created during Toge Greenhouse 2023, an internal game jam held by Toge Productions to create new, innovative, and experimental games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096600/extras/29db3e480529c3e19583848feb502a22.webp?t=1768473179\"></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Become the spectral death</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096600/extras/2a7a673152d1367c246ac81e127abe43.avif?t=1768473179\"></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A Noir tactical action game featuring a one-army strategy and instant-death combat. Slowly observe your surroundings, choreograph each killing move, finish your mission, and leave no survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096600/extras/29db3e480529c3e19583848feb502a22.webp?t=1768473179\"></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096600/extras/90560497cf5d9a648e1e83128816ad1d.poster.avif?t=1768473179\"></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Plan your movement and perform your attack cards to  clear each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Time is frozen in between your actions, use this opportunity to dodge bullets, take cover, and kill enemies effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Draft new cards to learn new skills and adapt to your missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once you complete your mission, replay your performance and watch your KILLDANCE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096600/extras/0ffea571ab2428510fda23d1a7e7a0e3.poster.avif?t=1768473179\"></span></p>"}